# PDU bytes only: no MBAP header, no unit identifier.
# Modbus Application Protocol V1.1b section 6.5, Write Single Coil, request example.
# Coil 173 ON. Upstream never sends function 05 (its echo check is dead code, MB-QUIRK-C),
# so the codec does not decode it: the function code is refused.
05 00 AC FF 00
